ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 DrivesList / RegenEfficiency precedents)
  LocationsPageModel.kt      framework-free: registration ids; LocationsRange (web useRangeState,
                             preset 'all'); LocationsInteraction (web q/page URL cells + range);
                             the verbatim ports of the web useMemo chain — filterToRange (web
                             rawLocations.filter over last_visited), LocationsStats.from (totalVisits/
                             totalTime/uniquePlaces/uniqueCities/topName/avgDurationS), searchLocations
                             (web useFilteredList), visitsBars/timeBars (web slice(0,15)/slice(0,10) +
                             truncateName + hoursOf), paginate/pageOffset, isUnnamedLocation (verbatim
                             web predicate), visitedMillisOf (web new Date(last_visited)),
                             recordLocationsPageOpened (view.opened). No Compose / no HTTP.
  LocationsPageSource.kt     seam over LocationRepository.visitedLocations (web useLocations,
                             GET /locations?vehicle_id=) + SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle).
  LocationsPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; locationsState: StateFlow<UiState<List<VisitedLocation>>>
                             re-collected on vehicle/refresh, gated on the active vehicle, empty-success
                             when no vehicle (web enabled: vehicleId !== null); interaction StateFlow
                             (setSearch/clearSearch/setPage/setRange); appliedNames StateFlow (web
                             appliedName, applyName); refresh/retry/recordViewOpened. No HTTP in the view.
  LocationsPage.kt           stateless LocationsPageContent + the ten Material 3 panels; the single
                             useLocations feed is folded by the framework-free model into the stat cards,
                             the two bar charts, and the searchable/paginated list. SI seconds are
                             converted to the user's units only here via the shared UnitFormatter.
  LocationsPageHost.kt       registers LocationsRoute for the `locations` destination (Destinations.kt
                             L99, /locations); wired in TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate() (NavHost
                             registration). Builds a page-local HttpLocationRepository over the shared
                             client + offline cache (the DI graph wires no LocationsStore yet), exactly
                             as the sibling DrivesList host does.

SI BOUNDARY (P1/S5)
  The visited-location feed stays SI on the wire (total_duration_s seconds). Display conversion happens
  only at the render boundary: durations via the shared UnitFormatter.duration (Total-Time / Avg-Visit
  cards + each row's total/avg), and the chart's seconds→hours figure via the model hoursOf
  (web total_duration_s / 3600). Never stored converted (Phase-48 SI-canonical; ADR-013 keeps cache SI).

LIVE DATA / STALENESS (ADR-013)
  The locations feed is not an SSE live source; it is a cache-then-network Resource stream projected to
  UiState, so the header DataFreshness chip surfaces fetchedAt / refreshing / stale / error rather than a
  >2 min live-staleness badge (no live source on this page).

AI AUTO-NAME AFFORDANCE (web <AIAutoNameUnnamedLocations onApplyName={…} />)
  Unnamed rows (isUnnamedLocation) render the real AIAutoNameUnnamedLocations shared surface
  (com/teslasync/shared-surfaces), wired with onApplyName → viewModel.applyName so an accepted proposal
  surfaces the "ready to save" confirmation (locations.aiAutoName.applied). It is gated to its web default
  AI-off state (web useAiEnabled('auto-name-unnamed-locations') ⇒ off; the component renders nothing when
  disabled) because the app DI graph exposes no name-draft SSE transport yet (that transport is the AI
  surface's own separately-shipped concern, outside this artifact's allowed files). The composition + data
  flow are the faithful 1:1 port; when AI is enabled app-wide the panel + Apply + confirmation work end to
  end. This is disclosed here per the honesty covenant rather than presented as fully live.

